WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:00.955
Proxima b.

00:01.707 --> 00:03.545
The nearest planet of another star.

00:04.017 --> 00:12.427
Its red sun is three times as wide as ours looks to us, and two dazzling stars, Alpha Centauri A and B, shine in its sky.

00:13.161 --> 00:15.033
Almost everything here is modelled.
